# Vector file for testcase6/sr_latch_gate.v.
# One line = one test cycle. Each token is name=bit. s/r are inputs
# (driven); q/qn are outputs (checked against the value given here).
# Each line is evaluated from a fresh X state (no memory across lines --
# see the NOTE in sr_latch_gate.v), so "hold" (s=0,r=0) settles to X.
s=1 r=0 q=1 qn=0
s=0 r=1 q=0 qn=1
s=0 r=0 q=x qn=x
s=1 r=1 q=0 qn=0
